The [[wikipedia:national flag|national flag]] of [[Qym]], is a horizontal triband of a top green stripe and bottom maroon stripe enveloping a central white stripe which is twice the height of the outer stripes. Centered on the white stripe is an [[wikipedia:Eastern gray squirrel|gray squirrel]] eating a [[wikipedia:chestnut|chestnut]] on a tree branch. 

